; Transport-free. yojson and the offline packages, nothing else: no unix, no
; lwt, no socket. The method catalogue, the JSON codecs and the submission and
; confirmation state machines are all pure, which is what lets the same client
; run over a Unix fd, a Solo5 vsock flow, or a table of canned replies.

(library
 (name tron_rpc)
 (public_name tron-rpc)
 (libraries tron-types tron-transaction yojson))
